                                    "description" => "If true, this enables the Java Transaction Service (JTS). If JTS is enabled then the transactions attribute of the 'iiop-openjdk' subsystem must be set to 'full'. This setting changes the internal mechanisms used in the transaction manager. It has no impact on the user working with JTA API.",
